{
    "title": "\u0646\u0628\u0623 Nabaa - \u0627\u062e\u0628\u0627\u0631 , \u0645\u0628\u0627\u0631\u064a\u0627\u062a",
    "description": "Choose your favorite sources from 2000 reliable news sources to follow the latest local, international and sports news to receive news, moment by moment.\r\n\r\nWith news, you will receive alerts for breaking news from your chosen sources!\r\n\r\nFollow the results of local and international matches and tournaments, match events, team rankings and scorers, first-hand schedule and results, with live coverage of the match with instant notifications, follow your favorite team from local and international leagues.\r\n\r\nWith the application of news, you can follow:\r\nEgypt News\r\nSaudi news\r\nGulf News\r\nInternational news\r\nNews Sports\r\nMatch results\r\n\r\nNabaa is the first free application through which you can follow all your favorite sources:\r\nThe seventh day - youm7\r\n Sky News Arabia\r\nAljazeera live\r\nal hadath / event\r\nalarabiya arabic\r\ncnn arabic\r\nAnd other local and international sources\r\n\r\nAnd many of the details and features that the application includes, you will get to know them once you download the Nabaa application\r\n\r\nWe are happy to receive your ideas and suggestions by writing to us on social media:\r\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/Nabaaapp\r\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/nabaaapp\r\nTwitter: https://twitter.com/nabaaapp",
    "descriptionHTML": "Choose your favorite sources from 2000 reliable news sources to follow the latest local, international and sports news to receive news, moment by moment.<br><br>With news, you will receive alerts for breaking news from your chosen sources!<br><br>Follow the results of local and international matches and tournaments, match events, team rankings and scorers, first-hand schedule and results, with live coverage of the match with instant notifications, follow your favorite team from local and international leagues.<br><br>With the application of news, you can follow:<br>Egypt News<br>Saudi news<br>Gulf News<br>International news<br>News Sports<br>Match results<br><br>Nabaa is the first free application through which you can follow all your favorite sources:<br>The seventh day - youm7<br> Sky News Arabia<br>Aljazeera live<br>al hadath / event<br>alarabiya arabic<br>cnn arabic<br>And other local and international sources<br><br>And many of the details and features that the application includes, you will get to know them once you download the Nabaa application<br><br>We are happy to receive your ideas and suggestions by writing to us on social media:<br>Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/Nabaaapp<br>Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/nabaaapp<br>Twitter: https://twitter.com/nabaaapp",
